| Semester-start demand exceeds the performance model | Medium | High | Search p95 exceeds 350 ms in pre-production load testing or database CPU exceeds 70% | Load-test at 2,000 users, add indexes and caching, scale application instances, and establish rate limits for abusive clients |
| Notification provider outage delays reminders | Medium | Medium | Failed or delayed notification queue exceeds 1% or oldest task exceeds five minutes | Use durable notification tasks, retries with backoff, provider monitoring and an operational report of missed reminders |
